    lines.extend(_verse(count))\n    return lines\n```\n\n处理的关键差异点：\n\n- 复数/单数：`99 bottles` / `1 bottle` / `no more bottles`。\n- 第一节首行首字母大写仅在本节为 0 瓶时生效（`No more bottles ...`，而第二处小写 `no more bottles of beer.`），用 `str.capitalize()` 实现，对 `\"99 bottles\"`、`\"1 bottle\"` 不产生副作用。\n- `count == 1` 用 `Take it down ... no more bottles of beer on the wall.`\n- `count == 0` 用 `Go to the store and buy some more, 99 bottles of beer on the wall.`\n- 其余用 `Take one down ... {count-1} of beer on the wall.`\n- 多节之间用空字符串行分隔；`recite(99, 100)` 会覆盖 99→0 共 100 节。\n\n## 验证情况\n\n按要求运行了 `python -m pytest -q`，但环境中 pytest 未安装：\n\n```\nC:\\Users\\21125\\AppData\\Local\\Programs\\Python\\Python311\\python.exe: No module named pytest\n```\n\n由于禁止安装依赖，且该环境只允许这一条固定的测试命令（其他 python/unittest 调用被拒绝），**测试没有实际跑通**，因此我不能声称测试已通过。我改为逐条对照 `beer_song_test.py` 中的期望输出做了人工核对：8 个测试用例（99、3、2、1、0 单节，`start=99,take=2`，`start=2,take=3`，以及 `start=99,take=100` 全部 100 节）与实现生成的文本一致；其中 99→0 的每节内容和空行分隔位置均已逐行比对。\n\n剩余工作：在装有 pytest 的环境中运行 `python -m pytest -q` 以确认。", "session_id": "evaluation", "usage": {"session_id": "evaluation", "run_id": "e48684165e5a477caa6932d4c3f06c08", "last_request": {"request_id": "48c5fde8-ee4a-487d-a35c-d6a18e8aef30", "session_id": "evaluation", "run_id": "e48684165e5a477caa6932d4c3f06c08", "provider": "deepseek-main", "model_id": "deepseek-flash", "purpose": "agent", "attempt": 0, "status": "completed", "started_at": 1791814773.3524227, "agent_id": "lead", "settled_at": 1791814778.2557476, "provider_request_id": "3ddb262c-815f-46ca-8640-5cefef44a16d", "usage": {"provider": "deepseek-main", "model": "deepseek-flash", "request_id": "48c5fde8-ee4a-487d-a35c-d6a18e8aef30", "session_id": "evaluation", "run_id": "e48684165e5a477caa6932d4c3f06c08", "agent_id": "lead", "purpose": "agent", "input_tokens": 13100, "output_tokens": 727, "cache_read_tokens": 12800, "cache_miss_tokens": 300, "cache_write_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 154, "total_tokens": 13827, "raw": {"response_metadata": {"finish_reason